Package: risk.decision
Title: Decision Quality Tools for Risk Assessment
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Cory", "Whitney", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Supports transparent risk assessment and decision analysis using
    explicit alternatives, uncertain outcomes, probabilities and values.
    Provides numerical summaries and visualizations as alternatives to
    categorical risk matrices.
